<title>BELGIUM: GENERALE BANK SETS 1997 RESULTS CALENDAR.</title>
<headline>GENERALE BANK SETS 1997 RESULTS CALENDAR.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's biggest bank, Generale</p>
<p>Bank, set the following dates for the release of earnings</p>
<p>information and payment of dividends in 1997:</p>
<p>    March 11 (after 1530 GMT)    Full-year 1996 results</p>
<p>    April 24			   Annual shareholders meeting</p>
<p>    May 12			     1996 dividend payment</p>
<p>    September 9			Half-year 1997 results</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
